@startuml Roots of Impact - HotelKit Integration Flow
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF

participant "HotelKit System" as HotelKit
participant "Integration Service" as Integration
participant "Task Service" as TaskService
participant "Database" as DB
participant "WebSocket" as WS
participant "Frontend" as Frontend

== Task Synchronization ==

HotelKit -> Integration: Webhook task.created\nwith taskId title category
Integration -> Integration: Map HotelKit task\nto Roots format
Integration -> TaskService: createTask(taskData)
TaskService -> DB: INSERT task\nwith external_id
DB --> TaskService: Task created
TaskService --> Integration: Task created
Integration -> Frontend: WebSocket new_task_available
Frontend -> Frontend: Refresh task list

== Task Completion Sync ==

Frontend -> Integration: User completes task\ntaskId userId
Integration -> TaskService: completeTask(taskId, userId)
TaskService -> DB: Record completion
TaskService -> Integration: Completion recorded

alt HotelKit Task with external_id
    Integration -> HotelKit: POST /tasks/{id}/complete\nwith employeeId timestamp
    HotelKit --> Integration: Success
    Integration -> DB: Update sync status
end

Integration -> Frontend: WebSocket task_completed\nwith points and tree
Frontend -> Frontend: Update UI

== Periodic Sync Fallback ==

loop Every hour
    Integration -> HotelKit: GET /tasks/employees\nstatus active
    HotelKit --> Integration: List of active tasks
    Integration -> Integration: Compare with DB
    alt New Tasks Found
        Integration -> TaskService: createTask\nfor new tasks
    end
    alt Tasks Removed
        Integration -> TaskService: deactivateTask\nfor removed tasks
    end
end

@enduml
